        "course.",
        "Students are required to complete 100 hours of community engagement with registration in the",
        "course below.",
        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2026/undergraduate/programs/jsom/computer-information-systems-and-technology (2026-07-26 18:29:31) 5/",
        "The BS CIST degree program requires students to focus on a specific concentration to obtain in-",
        "depth knowledge in a particular business area.",
        "Students may choose 9 semester credit hours from one of the following Concentrations.",
        "Students who wish to focus on analytical applications on a firm technical foundation can choose",
        "the Concentration in Business Analytics and AI, which requires 9 semester credit hours from the",
        "Students who wish to focus on the internal, integrated information systems within an organization",
        "Students who wish to focus on sales of technical products and services, must take 9 semester",
        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2026/undergraduate/programs/jsom/computer-information-systems-and-technology (2026-07-26 18:29:31) 6/",
        "D. IT Innovation and Entrepreneurship Concentration",
        "Students seeking to learn about developing business startups and/or driving technology",
        "innovation inside existing corporations, must take 9 semester credit hours from the following",
        "Students who wish to focus on cybersecurity within a firm technical foundation can choose the",
        "Concentration in Cybersecurity, which requires 9 semester credit hours from the following",
        "F. Information Technology and Systems Concentration",
        "that are not part of the BS CIST major preparatory, major core, or major related courses may be",
        "used to satisfy the 9 semester credit hours of guided elective credit.",
        "and up to 3 SCH of Individual Study based on the major to satisfy JURS program requirements.",
        "https://catalog.utdallas.edu/2026/undergraduate/programs/jsom/computer-information-systems-and-technology (2026-07-26 18:29:31) 7/",
